The following is a list of volumes of the [[Pokémon Adventures]] {{pkmn|manga}}. There are currently 64 volumes in total. To date, 63 volumes have been released in North America by [[VIZ Media]]; the first 41 volumes were released in Singapore by [[Chuang Yi]], with [[Shogakukan Asia]] picking up publication thereafter, currently with 10 volumes released. VIZ Media's first edition of {{PAV|1}} - {{PAV|7}} gave each volume its own title, like "Desperado Pikachu" for Volume 1.

Starting in July 2018, VIZ Media began releasing these volumes in a digital format by releasing sets of volumes by arc. This was completed on December 25, 2018.<ref>[https://www.viz.com/blog/posts/pokemon-digital-manga-release-guide VIZ | Blog / Pokémon Digital Manga Release Guide!]</ref> Afterwards, the later volumes would be released alongside their trade paperback counterparts.

==List of volumes==
Some volumes have the ISBNs of different editions listed: second edition (2E), digital edition (DE), or special edition (SE).
